    "lawCode": "Amd §911, Exec L",
    "lawSection": "Executive Law",
    "memo": "\n \nBILL NUMBER: S6895A\n\nSPONSOR: LITTLE\n \nTITLE OF BILL:  An act to amend the executive law, in relation to\ndesignating Chazy lake as an inland waterway for the purposes of water-\nfront revitalization\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nThis bill designates Chazy Lake as an inland waterway for purposes of\nwaterfront revitalization.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 amends paragraph (a) of subdivision 4 of section 911 of the\nexecutive law, as separately amended by chapters 43, 255 and 433 of the\nlaws of 2017 to expand the definition of \"inland waterway\" to include\nChazy Lake.\n\nSection 2 establishes an effective date.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThe Chazy Lake, local in Clinton County, is an integral part of the\nAdirondacks. It's a four mile nestled at the foot of Lyon, Johnson and\nEllenburg Mountains. The lake has incredible views and runs mainly north\nto south. It has a good fishery and is quite popular also.\n\nBy adding Chazy Lake to the list of inland waterways, surrounding muni-\ncipalities such as Dannemora, will be eligible to apply for state and\nfederal funding to further protect the lake and enhance infrastructure,\nfishing and local tourism to areas along the lake.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNew bill.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
